# pseudocode source: chapters/ch90.tex:59
# caption: Infer a nonrecursive let with environment-aware generalization.

REQUIRE pure expression let x = value in body; scheme environment; current solver
ENSURE body type or justified type error
infer value type tau while updating equality constraints
resolve tau and every relevant environment type under current substitution
Q <- FTV(tau) \ FTV(environment)
extend environment with x:forall Q.tau
infer body under the extended environment

